# Japan Weather Observations (JMA, daily and hourly)

Daily and hourly surface observations of every station of the Japan
Meteorological Agency (JMA), the official stations (気象台・測候所等) and
AMeDAS, as Parquet, updated every day.

> [!TIP]
> 日本語の紹介と分析例：<https://hotchpotch.github.io/japan-weather-dataset/>

- Stations: {{.Stations}} (including stations that no longer observe)
- Daily values from {{.DailyFrom}} and hourly values from {{.HourlyFrom}}, up to a day or two ago (JST). `manifest.json` gives the last day; values of recent days are preliminary.
- Source: JMA 「過去の気象データ・ダウンロード」 <https://www.data.jma.go.jp/risk/obsdl/>

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Not published by JMA or the Government of Japan. It is a processed copy
> made by a third party.

