## Usage

> [!TIP]
> With an AI agent (Claude Code, Codex, …), give this URL with your question:
> <https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hotchpotch/japan-weather-dataset/main/docs/usage.md>

```sql
-- DuckDB: the 10 stations with the most rain on 2019-10-12
SELECT s.name, d.date, d.precipitation_total
FROM 'hf://datasets/hotchpotch/japan-weather/daily/year=2019/*.parquet' d
JOIN 'hf://datasets/hotchpotch/japan-weather/stations/stations.parquet' s USING (station_id)
WHERE d.date = '2019-10-12' AND d.precipitation_total_quality IN (5, 8)
ORDER BY d.precipitation_total DESC
LIMIT 10;
```

Configs: `daily` (default), `hourly`, `stations`, `homogeneity_breaks`.
Use values with quality 8 (normal) or 5 (quasi-normal).

